title: "MacHelper"
abstract: "A free, open-source menu bar app and command-line tool for Apple Silicon Macs: system monitor, fan control, cache cleaner, disk analyzer and app uninstaller, with a JSON CLI and an agent skill for AI assistants. Everything runs locally."
